==Battleground==
*3 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*1 [[Zuche]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**15 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
**50 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
**30 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**6 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**15 [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Chickful A]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage's goal is to rush you down using enemy spam, however it can be countered by the exact same method: Cat spam.

[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] will be needed as a meatshield. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] will be able to take out the Zuches. Gabriel, Mr. Angel, Miz Devil, and The Thrillerz are enemies that you should be able to ignore although Pigeon de Sable can be a threat if you don't have high enough levels. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Phantom Cat (Rare Cat)|Bubble Cat]] have ideal spammability and enough range to attack Winged Pigge. Chickful A serves as the backliner, however it is not much of a threat as it will seldom make a dent in your defenses.

[[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], if well timed, can take out a massive amount of peons, making way for your heavy-hitters to take out Winged Pigge.

==Trivia==
*If you remove the ''no'' (の) from Hall of Feasting's Japanese name, Bansan no Kan (晩餐の館), it becomes [http://bansankan.jp/ Bansankan] (晩餐館), a well-known condiment brand.

